    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 4945,
      "versionNonce": 1549309960,
      "index": "bNR",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "g26aBl1ofCNMgsXZm4aYf",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -8739.592857012241,
      "y": 2585.96875726125,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 706.8994140625,
      "height": 550,
      "seed": 993926164,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1722181222190,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "L'operande auquel on veut acceder est specifie par un identificateur\n\nNote : regle de base, les deux oper utiliser doivent etre de la meme taille\n\nExemple:\n\nN  DB  4\nM  DW  EF00h\nTab  DB 1, 3, 5, 6, 7\nAlpha  DD  014FBC0Eh\n\n- Cop oper memoire\n    Cop N\n    Cop Tab+2\n\n- Cop registre, oper memoire\n    Cop AL, N\n    Cop BL, Tab+4\n    Cop BX, word PTR Alpha\n\n- Cop oper memoire, registre\n    Cop M, BX",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "L'operande auquel on veut acceder est specifie par un identificateur\n\nNote : regle de base, les deux oper utiliser doivent etre de la meme taille\n\nExemple:\n\nN  DB  4\nM  DW  EF00h\nTab  DB 1, 3, 5, 6, 7\nAlpha  DD  014FBC0Eh\n\n- Cop oper memoire\n    Cop N\n    Cop Tab+2\n\n- Cop registre, oper memoire\n    Cop AL, N\n    Cop BL, Tab+4\n    Cop BX, word PTR Alpha\n\n- Cop oper memoire, registre\n    Cop M, BX",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 786,
      "versionNonce": 1285052168,
      "index": "bNS",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "QwwiMYsRhbO6WyH6iBN8U",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
