      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntax\n    \n    - MOV dest, src\n    - Copie de la source dans la destination. Destination et source doivent etre de la meme taille\n\nDifferentes formes:\n\n    MOV registre1, registre2\n    MOV registre, oper memoire\n    MOV oper memoire, registre\n    MOV resgistre, oper immediat\n    MOV oper memoire, oper immediat\n\nEX:\n    \n    MOV AX, 300\n    MOV BL, AL\n    MOV CL, N",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntax\n    \n    - MOV dest, src\n    - Copie de la source dans la destination. Destination et source doivent etre de la meme taille\n\nDifferentes formes:\n\n    MOV registre1, registre2\n    MOV registre, oper memoire\n    MOV oper memoire, registre\n    MOV resgistre, oper immediat\n    MOV oper memoire, oper immediat\n\nEX:\n    \n    MOV AX, 300\n    MOV BL, AL\n    MOV CL, N",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1342,
      "versionNonce": 1437985032,
      "index": "bNg",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "bJhKTra0PkfFS2bytSKc7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -7570.849809172765,
      "y": 4100.727896150176,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 747.61572265625,
      "height": 73.95685517788367,
      "seed": 1581226037,
