      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntaxe\n\n    ADD dest, src\n    Addition de src et dst. Le resultat est mis dans dst.\n    \nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. ADD r1, r2\n    2. ADD r, opmem\n    3. ADD opmem, r\n    4. ADD r, opimd\n    5. ADD opmem, opimd\n\nEX:\n\n    MOV AL, M\n    ADD AL, N\n    MOV S, AL",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntaxe\n\n    ADD dest, src\n    Addition de src et dst. Le resultat est mis dans dst.\n    \nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. ADD r1, r2\n    2. ADD r, opmem\n    3. ADD opmem, r\n    4. ADD r, opimd\n    5. ADD opmem, opimd\n\nEX:\n\n    MOV AL, M\n    ADD AL, N\n    MOV S, AL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
