    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 3543,
      "versionNonce": 1086042120,
      "index": "bP1",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "fXK9pVkxXyD6yEgAl7MMe",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -3375.712304473471,
      "y": 997.6358702083411,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 778.9392700195312,
      "height": 675,
      "seed": 51531784,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1722181222190,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntaxe\n\n    ADC dest, src\n    Addition de src et dst. Le resultat est mis dans dst.\n    \nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. ADC r1, r2  -->  ( r1 + r2 + CF -> r1 ) // CF \"Carry flag\"\n    2. ADC r, opmem\n    3. ADC opmem, r\n    4. ADC r, opimd\n    5. ADC opmem, opmid\n\nNote:\n\n    Les instrutions ADD et ADC peuvent modifier certains indicateurs d'etat\n    et en particulier les bits CF, ZF, SF, PF, AF, OF\n\nEX :\n\n    N DB 20\n\n    MOV BL, 10\n    MOV CL, N\n    ADC CL, BL  ; avec CF = 1\n\n    (CL) = 0001 0100 + 0000 1010 + 1 = 0001 1111",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntaxe\n\n    ADC dest, src\n    Addition de src et dst. Le resultat est mis dans dst.\n    \nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. ADC r1, r2  -->  ( r1 + r2 + CF -> r1 ) // CF \"Carry flag\"\n    2. ADC r, opmem\n    3. ADC opmem, r\n    4. ADC r, opimd\n    5. ADC opmem, opmid\n\nNote:\n\n    Les instrutions ADD et ADC peuvent modifier certains indicateurs d'etat\n    et en particulier les bits CF, ZF, SF, PF, AF, OF\n\nEX :\n\n    N DB 20\n\n    MOV BL, 10\n    MOV CL, N\n    ADC CL, BL  ; avec CF = 1\n\n    (CL) = 0001 0100 + 0000 1010 + 1 = 0001 1111",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1005,
      "versionNonce": 1691905800,
      "index": "bP2",
