      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntaxe\n\n        INC r (8 ou 16 bits)\n        INC opmem (8 ou 16 bits)\n\nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. r = r + 1\n    2. opmem = opmem + 1\n\nEX :\n\n    INC DI  --> DI = DI + 1\n    INC AX\n    INC M",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntaxe\n\n        INC r (8 ou 16 bits)\n        INC opmem (8 ou 16 bits)\n\nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. r = r + 1\n    2. opmem = opmem + 1\n\nEX :\n\n    INC DI  --> DI = DI + 1\n    INC AX\n    INC M",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
