      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1722181222190,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntaxe\n\n    CMP dst, src\n        Comparaison entre la source et la destination\n    (destination) - (source)  --->  modification des bits du registre d'etat\n    ZF, SF, CF, PF, OF.\n\nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. CMP r1, r2\n    2. CMP r, opmem\n    3. CMP opmem, r\n    4. CMP r, opimd\n    5. CMP opmem, opimd\n\nEX :\n\n        CMP BL, AL\n            ZF = 1  ->  AL = BL\n            ZF = 0  ->  AL != BL\n            SF = 1  ->  BL < AL",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntaxe\n\n    CMP dst, src\n        Comparaison entre la source et la destination\n    (destination) - (source)  --->  modification des bits du registre d'etat\n    ZF, SF, CF, PF, OF.\n\nDifferentes formes:\n\n    1. CMP r1, r2\n    2. CMP r, opmem\n    3. CMP opmem, r\n    4. CMP r, opimd\n    5. CMP opmem, opimd\n\nEX :\n\n        CMP BL, AL\n            ZF = 1  ->  AL = BL\n            ZF = 0  ->  AL != BL\n            SF = 1  ->  BL < AL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1151,
      "versionNonce": 1936457992,
      "index": "bPI",
