      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntaxe\n\n    NOT r\n    NOT opmem\n\n    Complemetn a 1 d'un octet ou d'un mot\n    NOT r -> != r\n    NOT opmem -> != opmem\n\nEX :\n\n        MOV AL, OFh  ; AL = 0000 1111\n        NOT AL        ; AL = 1111 0000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntaxe\n\n    NOT r\n    NOT opmem\n\n    Complemetn a 1 d'un octet ou d'un mot\n    NOT r -> != r\n    NOT opmem -> != opmem\n\nEX :\n\n        MOV AL, OFh  ; AL = 0000 1111\n        NOT AL        ; AL = 1111 0000",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
