      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Syntaxe :\n\n    LOOP etiquette\n\n    CX = CX -1\n    \n    CX != 0  ->  branchement a l'etiquette\n    CX = 0  -> execution de l'instruction suivante\n\n    LOOPZ ou LOOPE\n\n    CX != 0 et ZF = 1  ->  etiquette\n    CX = 0 ou ZF = 0  -> suite\n\n    LOOPNZ\n    \n    CX != 0 et ZF = 0  -> etiquette\n    CX = 0 ou ZF = 1  -> suite",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntaxe :\n\n    LOOP etiquette\n\n    CX = CX -1\n    \n    CX != 0  ->  branchement a l'etiquette\n    CX = 0  -> execution de l'instruction suivante\n\n    LOOPZ ou LOOPE\n\n    CX != 0 et ZF = 1  ->  etiquette\n    CX = 0 ou ZF = 0  -> suite\n\n    LOOPNZ\n    \n    CX != 0 et ZF = 0  -> etiquette\n    CX = 0 ou ZF = 1  -> suite",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
